From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:57:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 202/260] [ae-patch] Name a Claude session's account at launch,
 and ask Usage for the picked account before a session exists

The statusLine shim names a session's Claude account only on its first render, so a new chat on a backup login showed the default login's usage until its first reply. The runner now writes claude_account at launch, and the Usage panels send the account picked for new chats (account=) so the server can answer a chat it has no reading for yet.
